                            <div class="retail-hero-content">
                                <div class="retail-kicker" data-i18n="retail.retail.ai.platform">Retail AI Platform</div>
                                <h1 class="retail-hero-title" data-i18n="retail.ai.platform.for.retail.operations.management">
                                    AI Platform for Retail Operations Management
                                </h1>
                                <div class="retail-meta-grid">
                                    <div class="retail-meta-card">
                                        <i class="bi bi-shop"></i>
                                        <span data-i18n-html="retail.store.operations.staff.loss.prevention">Store Operations<br />Staff • Loss Prevention</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="retail-meta-card">
                                        <i class="bi bi-cpu"></i>
                                        <span data-i18n-html="retail.computer.vision.behavior.analytics.bi">Computer Vision<br />Behavior Analytics • BI</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="retail-meta-card">
                                        <i class="bi bi-cloud-check"></i>
                                        <span data-i18n-html="retail.cloud.on.premise.hybrid.infrastructure">Cloud • On-Premise<br />Hybrid Infrastructure</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="retail-intro-text">
                                    <p data-i18n="retail.the.ai.powered.retail.operations.platform.transforms.existing">
                                        The AI-powered retail operations platform transforms existing store cameras and operational processes into a unified digital management system for store performance, staff productivity, loss prevention and customer experience.
                                    </p>
                                    <p data-i18n="retail.the.platform.helps.retailers.identify.not.only.isolated">
                                        The platform helps retailers identify not only isolated incidents, but also hidden operational losses such as out-of-stocks, long queues, planogram violations, shrinkage, staff inefficiencies and declining customer satisfaction.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="retail-hero-visual">
                                <img alt="AI-powered retail analytics platform" src="~/assets/img/retail/retail-hero.png" />
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section class="retail-modules-section">
                            <div class="retail-section-kicker" data-i18n="retail.core.ai.modules">Core AI Modules</div>
                            <h2 class="retail-section-title" data-i18n="retail.ai.modules.for.smarter.retail.operations">
                                AI Modules for Smarter Retail Operations
                            </h2>
                            <p class="retail-section-lead" data-i18n="retail.the.platform.includes.a.library.of.ai.modules">
                                The platform includes a library of AI modules for monitoring store operations, staff performance,
                                product availability, customer behavior, loss prevention, safety incidents and checkout processes.
                            </p>
                            <div class="retail-modules-grid">
